# Detection Engineering — Custom Wazuh Rules

## Overview

This directory contains custom Wazuh detection rules developed and validated in the **Enterprise SOC Threat Detection and Incident Response Lab**.

The objective is to demonstrate practical detection engineering skills, including:

- Security log analysis and event decoding
- Custom SIEM rule development
- Event correlation and threshold-based detection
- Linux authentication monitoring
- MITRE ATT&CK mapping
- Detection testing and validation
- SOC alert triage and incident documentation

The rules were tested using Wazuh Logtest and validated against live authentication activity generated in an authorized VirtualBox lab.

